  "description": "A simple, easy-to-use Result pattern implementation that transforms error-prone .NET code into bulletproof, maintainable applications. Replace try-catch blocks and null checks with elegant railway pattern operations. Chain operations safely with Then(), transform values with Transform(), and accumulate validation errors seamlessly. Zero dependencies, 100% test coverage, and real-world proven. Perfect for domain-driven design, API development, and functional programming enthusiasts. Free for personal/educational use.",
